{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>藝人邵子風近年經常在網上直播，儲落不少粉絲。今日邵子風在新田某餐廳開直播，豈料直播期間突然被一名光頭男「霸氣Q仔」狂打，看直播畫面至少向面部揮了五拳，鏡頭一轉邵子風已經血流滿面，狀甚恐怖。</p><figure><img alt=\"邵子風近在網上直播。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146126568037683200896752.jpeg/4kq9f6edigBkubhLIxBkJAI-ZxDKB6za27FSf9uxUn8\"/><figcaption>邵子風近在網上直播。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"突被光頭男狂打。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146126565944594432234806.jpeg/qSWRyleRjUObsIPRcQ3t9cA4u6qXu5wBh0mMyIdJjMg\"/><figcaption>突被光頭男狂打。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"血流滿面。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146126563755036672763852.jpeg/i1JZcDi4YWwblrOtCNyB2Jil5XP8uAojdOGWp3Thlqc\"/><figcaption>血流滿面。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"狀甚恐怖。（片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260623/1146126561280266240438906.jpeg/jmNPGvfLBJJl-Wiwj_RIlXmvZsaxnTtM8PrpV_D66Vc\"/><figcaption>狀甚恐怖。（片段截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-23T08:38:17.839486+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":4,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}